Z||000009||MinnGreenGT||08-13-2001||04:50 PM||||My Dad (Silver '88GT T-Top Owner) and I were discussing differnt PFF topics and I had mentioned the "Gullwing" door thread.  Which we both noted is a far-fetched idea on any normal Fiero.  BUT a T-Top vehicle that doesn't seem so bad.  Some extra framing would have to be added to the door & window frames, and we figured you'd need a auto open/close mechanism like on the new Chrysler minvan rear doors.  Maybe anything IS possible. Any adventurous T-Top owners out there?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
