Z||000016||MD_Fiero||08-14-2001||12:08 PM||||why would the body have to be re-constructed?...come on now...maybe ur right...but maybe you arent.....i see all of these other cars....no modified body panels...with those type doors...and the doors that a delorean has....no body modifactions done..if that can be done...this should be able to be done as well.||||reg||1
